汉化与界面改动部分（本项目）
==========================

本项目对 ImageJ 所做的中文本地化与界面改动，同样释出到公有领域
（Public Domain / CC0-1.0），不附加任何条件。

This project's Chinese localization and UI modifications are released into the
public domain (CC0-1.0), with no conditions attached.


第三方组件
==========

本项目分发包内置 OpenJDK 17 运行时（Microsoft Build of OpenJDK），
依据 GNU General Public License v2 with Classpath Exception 分发。
完整许可证文本随分发包提供，位于 runtime/legal/ 目录。

The bundled OpenJDK 17 runtime is distributed under the GNU General Public
License v2 with the Classpath Exception. Full license texts are included in
the distribution under runtime/legal/.
